     "title": "First Wednesday",
     "description": "<p>Would you like to connect with other members in your community? Join us in-person. We will provide a welcoming and respectful gathering space for members of the community to talk, and build positive community member relationships.</p>\n<p>This program is intended to create a gathering space for our senior community, but all adults are welcome.<br></p>\n<p>Light refreshments will be provided.</p><p><strong>Registration is not required.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\">ADA Accommodation Requests</a><br></p>",
