   "6aa1ac78f9ed2e00384f529a": {
    "id": "6aa1ac78f9ed2e00384f529a",
    "key": "2026-10-15T15:30:00",
    "seriesId": "6a95ae1c57c264087ad52147",
    "definition": {
     "start": "2026-10-15T15:30",
     "end": "2026-10-15T17:00",
     "title": "Homework Coaching with Lejla",
     "description": "<p>Need homework help? Students in Kindergarten through 5th grade can meet with volunteer Homework Coach Lejla in&nbsp;the Children's Room to get homework support.\u202f<strong>Students must have assigned homework to work on to participate in a session.&nbsp;Homework Coaches can help look up and&nbsp;explain concepts covered on assigned homework, support students as they work through their assignments, check work, provide a set&nbsp;time to work on homework, and redirect focus as needed.<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Free, with limited capacity. Homework Coach can work with up to 2 students at a time but can take new students if others finish their work early. If you're looking for 1:1 reading skill support, please visit with a Reading Buddy, <a href=\"https://sjpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events?_gl=1*xmcc1e*_ga*MTM2MjQ5NDU3Ni4xNjYzMDkzNjk2*_ga_G99DMMNG39*czE3ODgxOTI3NDUkbzc3JGcxJHQxNzg4MTkzOTE2JGo1NyRsMCRoMA..*_ga_F5QPDQX1BM*czE3ODgxOTI3NDUkbzc3JGcxJHQxNzg4MTkzOTE2JGo1NyRsMCRoMA..&q=Reading%20Buddies&locations=00\">click here for their schedule at the Children's Room</a>.</strong><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\" target=\"_blank\">ADA Accommodation Requests</a></p>",
     "partnerId": null,
     "bibIds": [],
     "featuredImageId": "5d75924edcb8184600360e58",
     "branchLocationId": "00",
     "nonBranchLocationId": null,
     "locationDetails": "Children's Room near Storytelling Area, 1st Floor",
     "audienceIds": [
      "5d5f0926be771f2300369397",
      "5d714d6c4464033900bac7c2"
     ],
     "languageIds": [
      "5d52fbb909c424450063680d"
     ],
     "programId": null,
     "typeIds": [
      "5d65e9ae2f3a81f8aeaabb9c"
     ],
     "isFeatured": null,
     "registrationInfo": {
      "provider": null,
      "enabledMethods": [],
      "cap": 3,
      "instructions": null,
      "maxSeats": 1,
      "scope": null,
      "waitlistEnabled": true,
      "waitlistAutoPromote": true,
      "onlineInstructions": "<p>Hello, and thanks for registering for Homework Coaching, Thursdays at 4pm in the <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/CWXwuEcsPabtMgsh7\" target=\"_blank\">Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Library</a> Children's Room. Please note that students must bring homework to participate in a&nbsp;session, and will be released from the session once their homework is finished or the session ends (5:30pm), whichever comes first.&nbsp;Students may have up to two other students working on their homework with them, so 1:1 help from a coach&nbsp;is not guaranteed.</p>\n<p>If you can no longer participate in this session, please cancel your registration using the links in this email OR by logging into your account on SJPL.org, clicking your username, and selecting \"My Events\" from the dropdown to manage registration for all of the events you've signed up for with our library.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks, and see you at the library!</p>",
      "instructionsToAttend": "<p>You've signed up for a Homework Coaching session tomorrow at 4:00pm at the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Dr.+Martin+Luther+King,+Jr.+Library/@37.3354867,-121.8875744,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x808fccbbfc65591d:0x74bd30e7ed5abda0!4m6!3m5!1s0x808fccbc0b22b081:0xe370813fc863d57f!8m2!3d37.3354825!4d-121.8849995!16zL20vMDUyd205?entry=tts&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTIwOS4wIPu8ASoASAFQAw%3D%3D&skid=72a7bf4f-ef38-45e7-afb4-28cf8c931919\" target=\"_blank\">Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Library</a>, in the Children's Room.</p>\n<p>- If you will arrive late to or can no&nbsp;longer attend&nbsp;the session, please call 408-808-2177 and let librarian Marsha know; please leave a message if no one answers.<br></p>\n<p>- Remember to bring your homework to the session! Having an assignment to work through is a prerequisite for participation.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Please reach out to Marsha at marsha.malcolm@sjlibrary.org if you will need special equipment for your assignment (a computer, a tablet, etc.). We will do our best to provide, but it may not be possible.</p>\n<p>See you at the library!</p>",
      "loginToRegister": false,
