   "6a55537617f387c203a4ffff": {
    "id": "6a55537617f387c203a4ffff",
    "key": "2026-11-17T14:00:00",
    "seriesId": "6a52c8f5dee4ff5300c90c07",
    "definition": {
     "start": "2026-11-17T14:00",
     "end": "2026-11-17T15:00",
     "title": "*Virtual* Digital Skills: Tr\u1ee3 Gi\u00fap K\u1ef9 N\u0103ng M\u00e1y T\u00ednh B\u1eb1ng Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t Qua Zoom (Computer Help)",
     "description": "<p><strong>Computer Help in Vietnamese via Zoom</strong></p>\n<p>Free. Available In Vietnamese </p>\n<p>Contact Rebecca Quan at <strong>rebecca.quan@sjlibrary.org</strong> to get the zoom link.</p>\n<p>Would you like to find out more about computers?</p>\n<p>Our staff can help you with basic computer skills: Learning the basics of Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint; Setting up an email account with strong password; Using social media such as Facebook and Zalo.</p>\n<p>And more\u2026<strong><br><br><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\">ADA Accommodation Requests</a></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><br><br>Tr\u1ee3 gi\u00fap k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t.&nbsp;</strong>Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed qua Zoom.</p>\n<p>Xin vui l\u00f2ng g\u1eedi email cho ch\u1ecb Rebecca t\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y&nbsp;<strong>rebecca.quan@sjlibrary.org</strong> \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng link t\u1edbi ph\u00f2ng h\u1ecdc tr\u00ean Zoom.<br></p>\n<p>Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn qu\u00fd v\u1ecb nh\u1eefng k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng sau: C\u00e1c k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint; T\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t tr\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ee5c email v\u1edbi m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u m\u1ea1nh.&nbsp;S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 Facebook v\u00e0 Zalo. M\u1ecdi th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3n ch\u00e0o!<br><br>Hosted by Evergreen Branch.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;#dsbDigitalSkills</p><p><br><a href=\"https://www.sjpl.org/ada-event-accommodation/\">ADA Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 tham gia ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh</a><br></p>",
